For taking mysql database backup command:

mysqldump  table_name > table_name.sql


For taking mysql database backup command (without date creation info):
mysqldump -t -u mayur7  -p  slotAvailabiltyRecords slotTrackerApp_rawmessages > Backup/raw_messages_without_date_creation_01_07_2021.sql


For taking mysql database backup command(witho date creation info):
mysqldump -u mayur7  -p  slotAvailabiltyRecords slotTrackerApp_rawmessages > Backup/raw_messages_01_07_2021.sql

For data from database backup file to mysql db command:
mysql -u mayur7 -p slotAvailabiltyRecords < raw_messages_without_date_creation_01_07_2021.sql
